From 646221da3df7326604f82e78c5f8b9a5d9b009ce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 15:22:05 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(operation): make cross drill excess-aware on coarse
 models

Thread reduced-fidelity model excess into every cross-drill construction
and verification law while GOUGE_TOL remains positive, and allow cross
drill in fidelity_law::excess_aware.
